    "detailed_description": "Over Circle is house escape game that you can play with your friends. <br>Symbols are the only way to escape to house.<br>All you have to think about is find the 9 symbols but at this time evil trying to kill you<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be Evil</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Don't let the others escape the house.<br></li><li>Reveal hidden symbols by use your special power. Use symbols to be invisible or increase your speed in this way you can kill them easily</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be Human</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Symbols are randomly generated each game in the house and their locations shown in the books.<br></li><li>You can freeze the evil for a short time.<br></li><li>All the while, you need to keep in touch with each other, help your friends, otherwise it won't be too hard to kill you.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Over Circle is house escape game that you can play with your friends. <br>Symbols are the only way to escape to house.<br>All you have to think about is find the 9 symbols but at this time evil trying to kill you<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be Evil</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Don't let the others escape the house.<br></li><li>Reveal hidden symbols by use your special power. Use symbols to be invisible or increase your speed in this way you can kill them easily</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be Human</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Symbols are randomly generated each game in the house and their locations shown in the books.<br></li><li>You can freeze the evil for a short time.<br></li><li>All the while, you need to keep in touch with each other, help your friends, otherwise it won't be too hard to kill you.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Find the symbols for escape the house, be attention and don't trust your friends because someone trying to kill you.",
